# Optional. A key here is substituted into the bundle at build time, and the
# Ask Claude card uses it instead of asking each reader for their own.
#
# It ends up in the JavaScript that ships, so set it only for a build nobody
# else loads — your own machine, or a page behind your own login. Left unset,
# the card asks for a key and holds it in the reader's browser instead.
#
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
